  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Jobsite.Runtime::Jobsite.Runtime.CrewMember
  characterId: ray
  displayName: Ray
  role: general foreman under schedule pressure; blunt, wants the pour on time, but
    backs down when a hazard is named clearly
  facts: The schedule is tight this week. Stop-work is allowed for real hazards;
    name the hazard and the fix. Materials and kits are at the supply rack by the
    trailers.
  endpoint: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1c305cab0dd4d6e43bd50f61ec5ffdcb, type: 2}
  offlineLine: 'Look for the energy: what could fall, move, shock or collapse here?'
